<div class="holiday-logic-info school-holiday-info">
    <p>School holiday dates are for <strong>government schools</strong> and are sourced from official state and territory education department calendars. Because term dates are set administratively and published year by year, coverage is limited to a range of years (currently 2025 onwards, extending to 2027&#8211;2030 depending on the state).</p>
    <p>Non-government (Catholic and independent) schools may use different dates. New South Wales figures use the Eastern Division calendar; Western Division "late-start" schools begin Term 1 about a week later.</p>
    <p>Dates are provided on a best-efforts basis. Verify with the relevant official source before relying on them.</p>
</div>
